§ `Tests -- s 7`

#ASSERT `s 7(1)(a) the settlement agreement is in the form prescribed` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 7(1)(a) the settlement agreement is in the form prescribed` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
